#: src/postulo/plugins/multiple_fields/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Let a field hold more than one value: several email addresses, telephone numbers, websites, social profiles, code repositories and messaging contacts. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on. Switched off, every one of them shows and uses its primary value only, and the others stay recorded and come back untouched."
msgstr "Lig do réimse níos mó ná luach amháin a choinneáil: roinnt seoltaí ríomhphoist, uimhreacha teileafóin, láithreáin ghréasáin, próifílí sóisialta, stórtha cód agus teagmhálacha teachtaireachtaí. Is é seo an lasc dóibh go léir le chéile; is féidir gach ceann acu a mhúchadh ina aonar fós fad atá sé seo ar siúl. Múchta, ní thaispeánann agus ní úsáideann gach ceann acu ach a phríomhluach, agus fanann na cinn eile taifeadta agus tagann siad ar ais gan athrú."

#: src/postulo/plugins/multiple_fields/__init__.py
msgid "Multiple fields"
msgstr "Réimsí iolracha"
